&lt;p&gt;Package gmode provides release mode management for project.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;​	软件包 gmode 为项目提供发布模式管理。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It uses string to mark the mode instead of integer, which is convenient for configuration.&lt;/p&gt;
